      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 4,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LOSSLESS CLIP CHAINING\n----------------------\nChaining through video costs a decode + re-encode at every join.\nThat round trip darkens the picture ~2.4% each time and compounds.\nChaining the latent skips it entirely.\n\nRUN 1 (first clip)\n  Load Latent stays BYPASSED (it is, already).\n  seed_video feeds the continuity as usual.\n  -> Save Latent writes output/h3_latents/clip_00001\n\nRUN 2 ONWARD\n  1. Select Load Latent, press Ctrl+B to un-bypass it.\n  2. Pick the newest file in its dropdown (newest is first).\n  3. Write the new prompt. Run.\n  -> Save Latent writes clip_00002, and so on.\n\nNOTES\n  seed_video can stay connected: once seed_latent is wired it is\n  used only to supply real audio for the continuation window.\n\n  Resolution is locked once you start. A latent cannot be resized,\n  so every clip in a chain must use the same one.\n\n  To redo a clip, just load the previous latent again. Nothing\n  earlier needs re-rendering.\n\nNAMING\n  Set filename_prefix on Save Latent per scene, e.g. sato_scene\n  -> sato_scene_00001, sato_scene_00002 ...\n  You can also rename files afterwards in\n  ComfyUI/output/h3_latents/ - keep the .safetensors ending\n  and they stay in the dropdown."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "LOSSLESS CLIP CHAINING\n----------------------\nChaining through video costs a decode + re-encode at every join.\nThat round trip darkens the picture ~2.4% each time and compounds.\nChaining the latent skips it entirely.\n\nRUN 1 (first clip)\n  Load Latent stays BYPASSED (it is, already).\n  seed_video feeds the continuity as usual.\n  -> Save Latent writes output/h3_latents/clip_00001\n\nRUN 2 ONWARD\n  1. Select Load Latent, press Ctrl+B to un-bypass it.\n  2. Pick the newest file in its dropdown (newest is first).\n  3. Write the new prompt. Run.\n  -> Save Latent writes clip_00002, and so on.\n\nNOTES\n  seed_video can stay connected: once seed_latent is wired it is\n  used only to supply real audio for the continuation window.\n\n  Resolution is locked once you start. A latent cannot be resized,\n  so every clip in a chain must use the same one.\n\n  To redo a clip, just load the previous latent again. Nothing\n  earlier needs re-rendering.\n\nNAMING\n  Set filename_prefix on Save Latent per scene, e.g. sato_scene\n  -> sato_scene_00001, sato_scene_00002 ...\n  You can also rename files afterwards in\n  ComfyUI/output/h3_latents/ - keep the .safetensors ending\n  and they stay in the dropdown."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
